{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54096","headline":"与大愿和尚诗（题拟） · 裴坦","name":"与大愿和尚诗（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"竟辞圣主宫中诏，来赴遗民社内期。\n（见贯休《禅月集》卷五《寄大愿和尚》注引）（按：贯休诗注云二句爲「太平裴相公与师诗」，又云：「时裴公出守锺陵，与师同行。\n」又云：「裴公镇襄阳，频使迎取，师坚不往。\n」《唐方镇年表》考之甚详，可参看。\n又前诗题中所称之「荐福大德显公」，岑仲勉以爲与此大愿应爲一人，只是「愿、显形近，未详孰正」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴坦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54096.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54096","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}